pbwinput 1
# The continue sequence for the oracle comparison (port/tools/oracle/README.md, "Saves"; oracle.py sequence continue):
# from first_save's save (first_save_w2_us.pbwinput, made on the oracle), power-on through the boot screens and the
# Game Freak logo to the opening, the title and the start menu as the title sequence goes (title_w2_us.pbwinput), which
# with a save shows CONTINUE first, with the save's player, play time, Pokédex and badges; then A takes CONTINUE into
# the field. On game frames, so that each press reaches both programs on the same pass of the game's main loop.
version w2_us
# START in the opening skips it to the title (count 1115 on both)
1100 START
1101 -
# START brings back the layers the title hid at count 2877
3000 START
3001 -
# START leaves for the start menu, which shows from count 3245 on the port and 3246 on the oracle (the title sequence's
# known differences: the DS starts Kyurem's cry later against its passes)
3100 START
3101 -
# CONTINUE, the start menu's first item with a save, once its window has opened
3400 A
3401 -
